{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>והביאום</b> Three times in the Masorah. One other: והביאום בבלה — in the prophecy of Jeremiah concerning the exile. And the other: ולקחום עמים והביאום אל מקומם — because they were bringing sacrifices to demons, for they were worshipping idols, therefore והביאום בבלה. And immediately when they repent they will return, as written: והביאום אל מקומם."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:19:37.118348548Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}